pan></abbr></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>TOOL_EXP_CAPSULE</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>A <b>Tool Exp Capsule</b> is a <span data-sort-value=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Rare\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-blue\" style=\"\">RARE</span></span></a></span> item.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Combining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Combining</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <b>Tool Exp Capsule</b> can be obtained from a max level <a href=\"/w/Farming_Tool\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Farming Tool\">Farming Tool</a>. Upon reaching level <span class=\"light-color color-green\">50</span>, all experience gained goes towards a <b>Tool Exp Capsule</b>. After reaching <span class=\"light-color color-green\">200,000</span> experience, the progress resets and the player is given a <b>Tool Exp Capsule</b>, and the following message will appear:\n</p>\n<div class=\"textsection-boxed\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-3\"><span class=\"format-l\">OVERFLOW! </span></span><span class=\"format-7\">Your &lt;tool&gt; has just dropped a </span><span class=\"format-9\">Tool Exp Capsule</span><span class=\"format-7\">!</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <b>Tool Exp Capsule</b> can be applied to any specialized Farming Tool to gain <span class=\"light-color color-green\">100,000</span> tool XP.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Combining\">Combining</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Combining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Combining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div><div class=\"mcui mcui-Anvil\"><div class=\"mcui-top\"><div class=\"mcui-hammer\"></div><div class=\"mcui-topleft\"><div class=\"mcui-header\">Combine Items</div><div class=\"mcui-guibar\"><div class=\"mcui-header mcui-guitext format-f\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mcui-bottom\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><div class=\"mcui-plus\"></div><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"rare\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;9Tool Exp Capsule\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;8Combinable in Anvil//&amp;7Grants &amp;b+100,000 Exp &amp;7to any of your/&amp;eFarming Tools&amp;7.//&amp;9&amp;lRARE\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Tool Exp Capsule\"><img alt=\"Tool Exp Capsule.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tool_Exp_Capsule.png/32px-Tool_Exp_Capsule.png?9232e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tool_Exp_Capsule.png/64px-Tool_Exp_Capsule.png?9232e 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><div class=\"mcui-arrow\"></div><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mcui-header mcui-cost\">Exp Levels Cost: 0</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>To get a tool from level 0 to 50 with just <b>Tool Exp Capsules</b>, it would take 494 capsules (costing <span data-bazaar=\"eyJsb25nIjpmYWxzZSwiY29pbiI6dHJ1ZSwicHJvZHVjdElkIjoiPExPQURJTkcuLi4+Iiwib3BlcmF0aW9uIjoiY2FsY0J1eVByaWNlcyIsImVudHJpZXMiOltbIlRPT0xfRVhQX0NBUFNVTEUiLDQ5NF1dfQ==\" class=\"bazaar-data-placeholder bazaar-data-operation-calcBuyPrices\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;coins</span></abbr></span> from the <a href=\"/w/Bazaar\" title=\"Bazaar\">Bazaar</a>).</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Tool_Exp_Capsule?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2025/December_5\" title=\"Changelog/2025/December 5\">Dec&#160;5,&#160;2025</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Tool_Exp_Capsule_(v1).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\">